#: includes/class-wp-statistics-db.php:101
msgid ""
"<b>(Add-on Advanced Reporting)</b> This table stores the messages that are "
"sent from this add-on."
msgstr "<b>(附加元件進階報告)</b>此表儲存此附加元件傳送的訊息。"

#: includes/class-wp-statistics-db.php:96
msgid ""
"<b>(Add-on Data Plus)</b> This table stores the events that are triggered on "
"your website. It helps you track user interactions and behavior."
msgstr "<b>(附加元件資料 Plus)</b> 此表格儲存您網站上觸發的事件。它可以幫助您追蹤使用者的互動和行為。"

#: includes/admin/class-wp-statistics-admin-privacy.php:56
msgid ""
"<b>Aggregated Statistics</b>: We only track general activity like page views "
"or country of access."
msgstr "<b>聚合統計</b>：我們只追蹤一般活動，例如頁面檢視或存取國家。"

#: includes/admin/class-wp-statistics-admin-privacy.php:55
msgid ""
"<b>Anonymized IP</b>: Your IP address is anonymized and securely processed "
"(e.g., hashed) so it can’t be reversed to identify you."
msgstr "<b>匿名 IP</b>：您的 IP 位址經過匿名和安全處理 (例如散列)，因此無法反向識別您的身份。"

#: includes/admin/class-wp-statistics-admin-privacy.php:78
msgid ""
"<b>Collecting IP Data</b>: Your IP address is recorded alongside your page "
"visits, which can sometimes be used to estimate your location (country, city)"
"."
msgstr "<b>收集 IP 資料</b>：您的 IP 位址會與您的頁面訪問一併記錄，有時可用於估計您的位置（國家、城市）。"

#: views/components/privacy-audit/hash-ips-unpassed.php:8
msgid ""
"<b>Compliance Risks:</b> Operating without this layer of data protection may "
"affect your website’s alignment with privacy regulations, necessitating "
"additional safeguards or disclosures."
msgstr "<b>合規風險：</b>在沒有這層資料保護的情況下運作，可能會影響您的網站與隱私權法規的一致性，因而必須採取額外的保障措施或揭露資訊。"

#: views/components/privacy-audit/store-ua.php:8
#: views/components/privacy-audit/stored-user-agent.php:12
msgid ""
"<b>Compliance with Privacy Laws:</b> Keeping this setting disabled by "
"default supports compliance with stringent privacy regulations by avoiding "
"the unnecessary collection of detailed user information."
msgstr "<b>符合隱私權法律：</b>預設停用此設定，可避免不必要地收集詳細的使用者資訊，以符合嚴格的隱私權法規。"

#: views/components/privacy-audit/hash-ips-unpassed.php:16
msgid ""
"<b>Consider Re-Enabling:</b> To enhance user privacy and ensure compliance "
"with privacy laws, it is advisable to re-enable the “Hash IP Addresses” "
"feature."
msgstr "<b>考慮重新啟用：</b>為了增強使用者隱私權並確保符合隱私權法律，建議重新啟用「散列 IP 位址」功能。"

#: views/components/privacy-audit/store-ua.php:16
#: views/components/privacy-audit/stored-user-agent.php:23
msgid ""
"<b>Considerations for Enabling:</b> Should you need to enable this feature "
"for debugging or optimization purposes, ensure it’s used judiciously and for "
"a limited time only."
msgstr "<b>啟用的注意事項：</b>如果您需要為了除錯或最佳化目的而啟用此功能，請確保僅在有限的時間內謹慎使用。"

#: includes/admin/class-wp-statistics-admin-privacy.php:80
msgid ""
"<b>Data Protection</b>: We keep IP records on our own server, secured and "
"accessible only to authorized staff. We do not share them unless required by "
"law."
msgstr ""
"<b>資料保護</b>：我們將 IP 記錄保存在自己的伺服器上，並加以保護，只有經過授權的員工才能訪問。除非法律要求，否則我們不會與他人分享。"

#: views/components/privacy-audit/stored-user-agent-unpassed.php:18
msgid ""
"<b>Data Removal:</b> For instructions on deleting previously stored user "
"agent data, refer to our guide <a href=\"https://wp-statistics."
"com/resources/how-to-clear-user-agent-strings/?utm_source=wp-"
"statistics&utm_medium=link&utm_campaign=privacy\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>."
msgstr ""
"<b>資料移除：</b>有關刪除先前儲存的使用者代理程式資料的說明，請參閱我們的指南 <a href=\"https://wp-statistics."
"com/resources/how-to-clear-user-agent-strings/?utm_source=wp-"
"statistics&utm_medium=link&utm_campaign=privacy\" target=\"_blank\"> 這裡</a>。"

#: includes/admin/class-wp-statistics-admin-privacy.php:90
msgid ""
"<b>Detailed Browser/OS Info</b>: The User-Agent string reveals your browser "
"version, operating system type, and sometimes device model or other "
"technical specifics."
msgstr "<b>詳細的瀏覽器/作業系統資訊</b>：User-Agent 字串會顯示您的瀏覽器版本、作業系統類型，有時還會顯示裝置型號或其他技術細節。"

#: views/components/privacy-audit/stored-user-agent-unpassed.php:17
msgid ""
"<b>Disabling After Use:</b> Remember to deactivate this setting after "
"debugging processes to ensure unnecessary data is not collected."
msgstr "<b>使用後停用：</b> 請記得在除錯程序後停用此設定，以確保不會收集不必要的資料。"

#: includes/admin/templates/pages/privacy-audit.php:29
msgid ""
"<b>Disclaimer</b><br><span>This audit only checks WP Statistics plugin "
"settings and helps improve privacy. It doesn't guarantee compliance with "
"laws like GDPR and doesn't review other plugins or third-party tools. For "
"full compliance, please consult a privacy expert. Remember, you're "
"responsible for your site's privacy.</span>"
msgstr ""
"<b>免責聲明</b><br><span>本稽核僅檢查 WP Statistics 外掛程式的設定，並協助改善隱私權。它不保證符合 GDPR "
"等法律，也不審核其他外掛程式或第三方工具。如需完全合規，請諮詢隱私權專家。請記住，您要對自己網站的隱私負責。"

#: views/components/privacy-audit/hash-ips-unpassed.php:17
msgid ""
"<b>Disclosure:</b> If there are specific reasons for keeping hashing "
"disabled, ensure transparent communication with your users by clearly "
"disclosing this in your privacy policy, including the implications for their "
"data privacy."
msgstr ""
"<b>揭露：</b>如果有特定的理由需要停用雜湊功能，請在隱私權政策中清楚揭露這一點，包括對使用者資料隱私的影響，以確保與使用者進行透明的溝通。"

#: views/components/privacy-audit/anonymize-ips-unpassed.php:16
msgid ""
"<b>Enable Anonymization:</b> We recommend enabling the “Anonymize IP "
"Addresses” feature to enhance user privacy and align with privacy laws and "
"best practices."
msgstr "<b>啟用匿名化：</b>我們建議啟用「IP 位址匿名化」功能，以提升使用者隱私，並符合隱私權法律和最佳實務。"

#: views/components/privacy-audit/anonymize-ips.php:9
msgid ""
"<b>Enhanced Privacy:</b> After anonymization, a hashing process is applied "
"to the IP address, further securing user data and making re-identification "
"through IP addresses highly unlikely."
msgstr "<b>增強隱私性：</b>在匿名化之後，會對 IP 位址進行散列處理，以進一步保護使用者資料，並使透過 IP 位址進行重新識別的可能性極低。"

#. translators: %s: string value
#: includes/admin/templates/settings/access-level.php:110
msgid "<b>Hints on Capabilities:</b>"
msgstr "<b>能力提示：</b"

#: views/components/privacy-audit/visitors-log-unpassed.php:9
msgid ""
"<b>Informed Consent:</b> Adequate measures are in place to inform users "
"about the data collection and to obtain their consent where necessary. This "
"may include consent banners, notifications, or other user interfaces that "
"clearly communicate this information."
msgstr ""
"<b>知情同意：</b>已採取適當措施告知使用者有關資料收集的資訊，並在必要時取得使用者的同意。這可能包括清楚傳達此資訊的同意橫幅、通知或其他使用者介面。"

#: views/components/privacy-audit/anonymize-ips.php:7
msgid ""
"<b>IPv4 Anonymization:</b> An IP address like 192.168.1.123 is transformed "
"into 192.168.1.0."
msgstr "<b>IPv4 匿名化：</b> IP 位址如 192.168.1.123 會轉換成 192.168.1.0。"

#: views/components/privacy-audit/anonymize-ips.php:8
msgid ""
"<b>IPv6 Anonymization:</b> An IPv6 address like 2001:0db8:85a3:0000:0000:"
"8a2e:0370:7334 becomes 2001:0db8:85a3::."
msgstr ""
"<b>IPv6 匿名化：</b> IPv6 位址如 2001:0db8:85a3:0000:0000:8a2e:0370:7334 變成 2001:"
"0db8:85a3::。"

#: views/components/privacy-audit/anonymize-ips-unpassed.php:8
msgid ""
"<b>Legal Compliance:</b> Storing complete IP addresses may affect your "
"compliance with privacy laws such as GDPR, requiring careful consideration "
"and potentially additional safeguards."
msgstr ""
"<b>法律合規性：</b>儲存完整的 IP 位址可能會影響您對隱私權法律 (例如 GDPR) 的合規性，因此需要謹慎考量，並可能需要額外的保障措施。"

#: includes/admin/class-wp-statistics-admin-privacy.php:68
msgid ""
"<b>Local & Secure Storage</b>: These logs are kept securely on our server "
"and are not shared externally."
msgstr "<b>本機與安全儲存</b>：這些記錄會安全地保存在我們的伺服器上，不會與外部共用。"

#: includes/admin/class-wp-statistics-admin-privacy.php:57
msgid ""
"<b>Local Storage</b>: All data is stored locally on our server; we never "
"share it with third parties."
msgstr "<b>本機儲存</b>：所有資料都儲存在本機伺服器上；我們絕不與第三方共用。"

#: includes/admin/class-wp-statistics-admin-privacy.php:93
msgid ""
"<b>Local Storage</b>: All User-Agent data is stored on our server and not "
"shared with third parties unless required by law. We periodically review and "
"may remove these logs."
msgstr ""
"<b>本地儲存</b>：所有 User-Agent 資料都儲存在我們的伺服器上，除非法律要求，否則不會與第三方共用。我們會定期檢視並移除這些記錄。"

#: views/components/privacy-audit/hash-ips.php:28
msgid ""
"<b>Maintain Enabled Status:</b> Keeping this feature enabled is recommended "
"to uphold the highest standards of user privacy and security. This default "
"setting ensures that all IP addresses are hashed from the start, offering a "
"robust privacy-first approach."
msgstr ""
"<b>保持啟用狀態：</b>建議保持啟用此功能，以維護最高標準的使用者隱私和安全性。此預設設定可確保所有 IP "
"位址從一開始就進行散列，提供強大的隱私第一方法。"

#: includes/admin/class-wp-statistics-admin-privacy.php:54
msgid ""
"<b>No Cookies</b>: We do not set tracking cookies or similar identifiers in "
"your browser."
msgstr "<b>無 Cookie</b>：我們不會在您的瀏覽器中設定追蹤 Cookie 或類似識別碼。"

#: src/Service/Admin/PrivacyAudit/Faqs/TransferData.php:19
msgid ""
"<b>No</b>, WP Statistics is designed to store all analytics data directly "
"within your WordPress database."
msgstr "<b>不</b>，WP Statistics 被設計為直接在您的 WordPress 資料庫中儲存所有分析資料。"

#. translators: %s: Link to documentation.
#: includes/admin/templates/settings/exclusions.php:172
#, php-format
msgid ""
"<b>Note</b>: Once added, traffic from matching URLs will stop being tracked. "
"For more detailed information, <a href=\"%s\" target=\"_blank\">click "
"here</a>."
msgstr ""
"<b>注意</b>：一旦新增，來自匹配 URL 的流量將停止被追蹤。如需詳細資訊，<a href=\"%s\" target=\"_blank\">"
"請點選此處</a>。"

#: includes/admin/templates/settings/privacy.php:159
msgid ""
"<b>Note</b>: This feature is currently in beta and enables user tracking "
"while adhering to privacy laws. Users are advised to review and ensure "
"compliance with applicable legal requirements in their jurisdiction."
msgstr "<b>注意</b>：此功能目前處於測試階段，可在遵守隱私權法律的同時追蹤使用者。建議使用者檢閱並確保符合其司法管轄區的適用法律規定。"

#: includes/admin/class-wp-statistics-admin-privacy.php:92
msgid ""
"<b>Potential Identifiability</b>: Although this data generally does not "
"include your name or email, detailed User-Agent strings can (in rare cases) "
"be used to identify unique browsing configurations."
msgstr "<b>潛在識別能力</b>：雖然這些資料通常不包括您的姓名或電子郵件，但詳細的使用者代理字串（在極少數情況下）可用於識別獨特的瀏覽配置。"

#: views/components/privacy-audit/stored-user-agent-unpassed.php:8
msgid ""
"<b>Privacy Compliance:</b> The activation of this feature necessitates clear "
"disclosure within your privacy policy about the collection of full user "
"agent strings and their purpose."
msgstr "<b>隱私權規範：</b>啟用此功能後，您必須在隱私權政策中清楚揭露收集完整使用者代理程式字串及其目的。"

#: includes/admin/class-wp-statistics-admin-privacy.php:81
msgid ""
"<b>Privacy Considerations</b>: Since IP addresses may be considered personal "
"data, we take reasonable measures to protect them. You can contact us "
"regarding removal or other data rights if you feel your IP address is "
"personally identifying."
msgstr ""
"<b>隱私權注意事項</b>：由於 IP 位址可能會被視為個人資料，因此我們會採取合理的措施加以保護。如果您認為您的 IP "
"位址具有個人識別功能，您可以就移除或其他資料權利與我們聯絡。"

#: views/components/privacy-audit/hash-ips.php:14
msgid ""
"<b>Privacy Enhancement:</b> Through this process, WP Statistics supports "
"privacy compliance by anonymizing visitor data, thus aligning with stringent "
"privacy regulations."
msgstr "<b>Privacy Enhancement：</b>透過此程序，WP Statistics 可將訪客資料匿名化，以符合嚴格的隱私權規定。"

#: views/components/privacy-audit/store-ua.php:7
#: views/components/privacy-audit/stored-user-agent.php:8
msgid ""
"<b>Privacy Preservation:</b> Disabling this feature helps prevent the "
"collection of data that could potentially identify individuals, fostering a "
"safer and more private browsing experience."
msgstr "<b>隱私保護：</b>停用此功能有助於防止收集可能識別個人身份的資料，從而提供更安全、更隱私的瀏覽體驗。"

#: views/components/privacy-audit/anonymize-ips-unpassed.php:7
msgid ""
"<b>Privacy Risks:</b> Without anonymization, IP addresses are considered "
"Personally Identifiable Information (PII) and could pose privacy risks to "
"your users."
msgstr "<b>隱私風險：</b>如果沒有進行匿名化，IP 位址會被視為個人識別資訊 (PII)，可能會對您的使用者造成隱私風險。"

#: views/components/privacy-audit/anonymize-ips.php:17
msgid ""
"<b>Privacy-First Approach:</b> Keeping this feature enabled is strongly "
"recommended as it aligns with best data protection practices and compliance "
"with various privacy laws and regulations."
msgstr "<b>Privacy-First Approach：</b>強烈建議啟用此功能，因為它符合最佳資料保護實務和各種隱私權法律法規。"

#: includes/admin/class-wp-statistics-admin-privacy.php:67
msgid ""
"<b>Purpose</b>: This helps us understand how registered members use our site "
"and improve their experience."
msgstr "<b>目的</b>： 這有助於我們瞭解註冊會員如何使用我們的網站，並改善他們的體驗。"

#: includes/admin/class-wp-statistics-admin-privacy.php:91
msgid ""
"<b>Purpose</b>: We use this information for diagnostic or compatibility "
"analysis, to ensure our site functions well across different setups."
msgstr "<b>目的</b>：我們使用此資訊進行診斷或相容性分析，以確保我們的網站在不同的設定下都能運作良好。"

#: views/components/privacy-audit/hash-ips-unpassed.php:7
msgid ""
"<b>Reduced Privacy:</b> Disabling hashing reduces the level of privacy "
"protection for user data, as IP addresses can be stored in a form that may "
"be traceable to individuals."
msgstr "<b>降低隱私：</b>停用雜湊功能會降低使用者資料的隱私保護等級，因為 IP 位址可能會以可追蹤到個人的形式儲存。"

#: views/components/privacy-audit/hash-ips.php:32
msgid ""
"<b>Retroactive Hashing:</b> For users seeking to enhance privacy for "
"previously stored data, WP Statistics offers guidance on converting existing "
"IP addresses to hashes, further strengthening privacy measures."
msgstr ""
"<b>Retroactive Hashing：</b>對於尋求增強先前儲存資料隱私的使用者，WP Statistics 提供將現有 IP "
"位址轉換為雜湊值的指引，進一步強化隱私措施。"

#: views/components/privacy-audit/visitors-log-unpassed.php:10
msgid ""
"<b>Review and Action:</b> Regularly review the necessity of keeping this "
"feature enabled. If the feature is no longer needed, or if you wish to "
"enhance user privacy, consider disabling it. Refer to our guide on <a "
"href=\"https://wp-statistics.com/resources/avoiding-pii-data-collection/?"
"utm_source=wp-statistics&utm_medium=link&utm_campaign=privacy\" "
"target=\"_blank\">Adjusting Your Privacy Settings</a> for detailed "
"instructions on managing this feature."
msgstr ""
"<b>檢閱與行動：</b>定期檢閱保持啟用此功能的必要性。如果不再需要此功能，或者如果您希望加強使用者隱私權，請考慮停用此功能。請參閱我們的 <a "
"href=\"https://wp-statistics.com/resources/avoiding-pii-data-collection/?"
"utm_source=wp-statistics&utm_medium=link&utm_campaign=privacy\" "
"target=\"_blank\"> 調整您的隱私設定</a>指南，以取得管理此功能的詳細說明。"

#: views/components/privacy-audit/anonymize-ips-unpassed.php:17
msgid ""
"<b>Review Privacy Practices:</b> If you have specific reasons for keeping "
"this feature disabled, ensure you have adequate measures in place to protect "
"user data and comply with applicable laws. This might include obtaining "
"explicit consent from users for processing their complete IP addresses."
msgstr ""
"<b>檢閱隱私權實務：</b>"
"如果您有特定的理由要停用此功能，請確保您有足夠的措施保護使用者資料，並遵守適用的法律。這可能包括取得使用者的明確同意，以處理其完整的 IP 位址。"

#: views/components/privacy-audit/stored-user-agent-unpassed.php:16
msgid ""
"<b>Selective Use:</b> Enable this feature only as needed for troubleshooting "
"or enhancing website functionality."
msgstr "<b>選擇性使用：</b>僅在排除故障或增強網站功能需要時啟用此功能。"

#: views/components/privacy-audit/stored-user-agent-unpassed.php:7
msgid ""
"<b>Temporary Activation:</b> Intended for short-term diagnostic purposes, "
"it’s recommended to disable this feature once specific issues have been "
"resolved to minimize the collection of extensive user data."
msgstr "<b>臨時啟動：</b>用於短期診斷目的，建議在特定問題解決後停用此功能，以盡量減少收集大量使用者資料。"

#: views/components/privacy-audit/store-ua.php:17
#: views/components/privacy-audit/stored-user-agent.php:27
msgid ""
"<b>Transparency with Users:</b> If activated, update your privacy policy to "
"reflect the temporary collection of full user agent strings, including the "
"purpose and scope of data collection."
msgstr "<b>對使用者的透明度：</b>如果啟用，請更新您的隱私權政策，以反映暫時收集完整使用者代理程式字串的情況，包括資料收集的目的和範圍。"

#: views/components/privacy-audit/anonymize-ips.php:18
msgid ""
"<b>Transparency:</b> Ensure your privacy policy reflects this practice, "
"enhancing trust with your site visitors."
msgstr "<b>透明度：</b>確保您的隱私權政策反映出這種做法，以提高網站訪客對您的信任。"

#: views/components/privacy-audit/visitors-log-unpassed.php:8
msgid ""
"<b>Transparency:</b> Your website’s privacy policy should clearly describe "
"the data collection practices, including the specific types of data "
"collected and their intended use."
msgstr "<b>透明度：</b>您網站的隱私權政策應清楚說明資料收集作法，包括所收集資料的特定類型及其預期用途。"

#: views/components/privacy-audit/hash-ips.php:10
msgid ""
"<b>Unique Visitor Counting:</b> The system counts unique visitors by hashing "
"a combination of the IP address, User-Agent string, and a daily-changing "
"salt. This ensures each visitor’s identifier is unique and secure for that "
"day."
msgstr ""
"<b>唯一訪客計數：</b>系統透過對 IP 位址、User-Agent "
"字串和每日變更的鹽值進行散列組合來計數唯一訪客。這可確保每位訪客的識別碼在當天都是唯一且安全的。"

#: includes/admin/class-wp-statistics-admin-privacy.php:66
msgid ""
"<b>User ID & Page Views</b>: If you are logged in, we associate your account "
"(username/ID) with your page visits."
msgstr "<b>使用者 ID 與頁面瀏覽次數</b>：如果您已登入，我們會將您的帳戶（使用者名稱/ID）與您的頁面瀏覽次數相關聯。"

#: includes/admin/class-wp-statistics-admin-privacy.php:46
msgid ""
"<b>We use the WP Statistics plugin to analyze traffic on our website.</b> WP "
"Statistics stores its data on our own server and does not transmit it to any "
"third parties. Below, we describe what information we collect through WP "
"Statistics, why we collect it, and how it is handled. If you have questions "
"or concerns about our analytics practices, please contact us or review the "
"<a href=\"https://wp-statistics.com/resources/wp-statistics-data-privacy/?"
"utm_source=wp-statistics&utm_medium=link&utm_campaign=privacy-policy\" "
"target=\"_blank\">WP Statistics Data Privacy guide.</a>"
msgstr ""
"<b>我們使用 WP Statistics 外掛程式來分析我們網站的流量。</b>WP Statistics "
"將資料儲存在我們自己的伺服器上，不會傳送給任何第三方。以下，我們將說明我們透過 WP Statistics "
"收集哪些資訊、為何收集這些資訊，以及如何處理這些資訊。如果您對我們的分析實務有疑問或顧慮，請聯繫我們或檢閱<a href=\"https://wp-"
"statistics.com/resources/wp-statistics-data-privacy/?utm_source=wp-"
"statistics&utm_medium=link&utm_campaign=privacy-policy\" target=\"_blank\">"
"WP統計數據隱私指南。"

#: includes/admin/class-wp-statistics-admin-privacy.php:79
msgid ""
"<b>Why We Store IPs</b>: This helps us detect unique visits, identify "
"possible misuse or security issues, and gather accurate traffic data."
msgstr "<b>我們儲存 IP 的原因</b>： 這有助於我們偵測獨特的造訪、識別可能的濫用或安全問題，以及收集精確的流量資料。"

#. translators: %1$s: Settings URL, %2$s: Optimization URL, %3$s: Documentation URL
#: src/Service/Admin/NoticeHandler/GeneralNotices.php:193
#, php-format
msgid ""
"<b>WP Statistics Notice (Database Maintenance Recommended):</b> Your "
"database has accumulated many records, which could slow down your site. To "
"improve performance, go to <a href=\"%1$s\">Settings → Data Management</a> "
"to enable the option that stops recording old visitor data, and visit the <a "
"href=\"%2$s\">Optimization page</a> to clean up your database. This process "
"only removes detailed old visitor logs but retains aggregated data. Your "
"other data and overall statistics will remain unchanged. For more details, "
"<a href=\"%3$s\" target=\"_blank\">click here</a>."
msgstr ""
"<b>WP統計通知（建議進行資料庫維護）：</b>您的資料庫已累積許多記錄，可能會導致網站速度變慢。若要改善效能，請前往 <a href=\"%1$s「>"
" 設定 → 資料管理</a>，啟用停止記錄舊訪客資料的選項，並前往 <a href=」%2$s\"> 最佳化頁面</a>"
"清理您的資料庫。此程序僅移除詳細的舊訪客記錄，但會保留彙總資料。您的其他資料和整體統計資料將維持不變。如需詳細資訊，<a href=\"%3$s\" "
"target=\"_blank\">請點選此處</a>。"

#. translators: %1$s: string value, %2$s: string value, %3$s: string value
#: src/Service/Admin/NoticeHandler/GeneralNotices.php:126
#, php-format
msgid ""
"<b>WP Statistics Notice:</b> The cache plugin %1$s is detected, please make "
"sure the <code>%2$s</code> file is excluded from file optimization and "
"caching, <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"%3$s\">Click here</a> for more info."
msgstr ""
"<b>WP 統計通知：</b>偵測到快取記憶體外掛程式 %1$s，請確定 <code>%2$s</code> "
"檔案已排除在檔案最佳化與快取記憶體之外，<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"%3$s\">點選此處</a>取得更多資訊。"

#. translators: %1$s: string value, %2$s: string value
#: src/Service/Admin/NoticeHandler/GeneralNotices.php:154
#, php-format
msgid ""
"<b>WP Statistics:</b> Server-Side tracking is deprecated. Please switch to "
"Client-Side for better accuracy. <br> <a href=\"%1$s\">Go to Tracking "
"Settings</a> · <a href=\"%2$s\" target=\"_blank\">Read the Deprecation "
"Guide</a>"
msgstr ""
"<b>WP 統計：</b> 伺服器端追蹤功能已停用。請切換至用戶端以獲得更好的準確性。<br> <a href=\"%1$s「>前往追蹤設定</a> - "
"<a href=」%2$s\" target=\"_blank\">閱讀停用指南</a>。"

#. translators: %1$s: string value
#: src/Service/Admin/NoticeHandler/GeneralNotices.php:356
#, php-format
msgid ""
"<b>WP Statistics:</b> Your database needs a quick update. <a href=\"%1$s\">"
"Run the Database Maintenance tool</a> to keep your stats accurate."
msgstr "<b>WP統計：</b>您的資料庫需要快速更新。<a href=\"%1$s\">執行資料庫維護工具</a>以保持您的統計資料準確。"

#: includes/admin/class-wp-statistics-admin-privacy.php:69
msgid ""
"<b>Your Choices</b>: You can choose to browse without logging in if you "
"prefer not to link your visits with your user account. You may also contact "
"us to request removal of any collected data where legally applicable."
msgstr ""
"<b>您的選擇</b>：如果您不想將您的瀏覽與您的使用者帳戶連結，您可以選擇不登入瀏覽。在法律適用的情況下，您也可以聯絡我們要求移除任何收集的資料。"

#. translators: %1$s: string value, %2$d: number value, %3$d: number value, %4$d: number value, %5$s: string value
#: src/Service/Database/Migrations/BackgroundProcess/BackgroundProcessManager.php:384
#, php-format
msgid ""
"<div id=\"wp-statistics-async-background-process-notice\">%1$s: <span "
"class=\"percentage\">%2$d%%</span> complete (<span class=\"processed\">"
"%3$d</span>/%4$d).<br/> %5$s</div>"
msgstr ""
"<div id=\"wp-statistics-async-background-process-notice\">%1$s：<span "
"class=「百分比」>%2$d%%</span>完成 (<span class=「已處理」>%3$d</span>/%4$d).<br/>"
"%5$s</div>。"

#: views/components/privacy-audit/unhashed-ip.php:6
msgid ""
"<ol>\n"
"                <li>Go to the <b>Optimization</b> section.</li>\n"
"                <li>Select <b>Plugin Maintenance</b>.</li>\n"
"                <li>Choose <b>Convert IP Addresses to Hash</b> to start the "
"conversion process.</li>\n"
"            </ol>\n"
"            <p>This step will transform all existing raw IP addresses in "
"your database into hashed formats, significantly improving user privacy and "
"your website’s compliance with data protection regulations.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<ol\n"
"                <li>前往 <b>Optimization</b> 區段。\n"
"                <li>選擇 <b>外掛程式維護</b>。\n"
"                <li>選擇 <b>將 IP 位址轉換為切細值</b>，以啟動轉換程序。\n"
"            </ol\n"
"            <p>此步驟會將資料庫中所有現有的原始 IP 位址轉換為散列格式，大幅改善使用者隱私，並使您的網站符合資料保護規定。"

#: views/components/privacy-audit/stored-user-id.php:6
msgid ""
"<ol>\n"
"                <li>Go to the <b>Optimization</b> tab in the WP Statistics "
"settings.</li>\n"
"                <li>Click on <b>Data Cleanup</b>.</li>\n"
"                <li>Select <b>Remove User IDs</b> to start the removal "
"process.</li>\n"
"            </ol>\n"
"            <p>Initiating this process will delete all previously stored "
"User IDs, further securing user data and aligning your site with best "
"privacy practices.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<ol\n"
"                <li>前往 WP 統計設定中的<b>最佳化</b>索引標籤。\n"
"                <li>按一下 <b>資料清理</b>。\n"
"                <li>選擇 <b>移除使用者 ID</b>開始移除程序。\n"
"            </ol\n"
"            <p> 啟動此程序將刪除所有先前儲存的使用者 ID，進一步保護使用者資料，並使您的網站符合最佳隱私權實務。"

#: views/components/modals/introduce-premium/step-details.php:28
msgid ""
"<p><b>Thank you for supporting us by being a Premium user! Since you "
"previously had the Bundle, you now have access to all the Premium features. "
"There’s nothing more you need to do—just enjoy the full range of advanced "
"tools and insights.</b></p>\n"
"            <p>We truly appreciate your continued support. With your help, "
"we’re able to keep improving and providing even better analytics for your "
"site.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>感謝您成為 Premium 使用者來支持我們！由於您之前已購買了 Bundle，因此現在您可使用所有 Premium "
"功能。您无需再做其他任何事情，只需享受全面的高级工具和洞察力即可。\n"
"            <p>我們衷心感謝您的持續支持。有了您的幫助，我們才能不斷改進，為您的網站提供更好的分析。"

#: src/Service/Admin/PrivacyAudit/Faqs/RequireMention.php:25
msgid ""
"<p>According to your current setup, WP Statistics is not configured to "
"record any personal data. This means that technically, you do not need to "
"mention WP Statistics in your privacy policy. However, to foster an "
"environment of utmost transparency with your users, we still encourage "
"mentioning the use of WP Statistics. This helps inform users about the "
"analytics tools employed by your site, reinforcing trust through "
"transparency.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>根據您目前的設定，WP Statistics 未設定為記錄任何個人資料。這意味著在技術上，您不需要在隱私政策中提及 WP "
"Statistics。然而，為了對您的用戶營造一個最大透明度的環境，我們仍然鼓勵提及 WP Statistics "
"的使用。這將有助於告知用戶您的網站所使用的分析工具，並透過透明度加強信任。"

#. translators: %s: string value
#: views/components/modals/introduce-premium/step-details.php:88
#, php-format
msgid ""
"<p>Advanced Reporting keeps you informed by sending detailed performance "
"reports directly to your inbox. Gain insights into your website's traffic, "
"views, and key metrics through customizable email reports. Schedule updates "
"to receive data as often as you like, and export your data to CSV or PDF for "
"offline analysis and sharing. Stay up-to-date on your website's performance "
"with clear, graphical insights. <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"%s\">Learn "
"more</a></p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Advanced Reporting "
"可直接將詳細的效能報告傳送到您的收件匣，讓您隨時掌握資訊。透過可自訂的電子郵件報告，深入瞭解您網站的流量、瀏覽量和關鍵指標。您可以排程更新，隨時接收資料，並將資料匯出為"
" CSV 或 PDF 格式，以便離線分析和分享。透過清晰的圖表洞察，隨時掌握網站的最新績效。<a target=\"_blank\" "
"href=\"%s\">瞭解更多</a></p>。"

#. translators: %s: string value
#: views/components/modals/introduce-premium/step-details.php:112
#, php-format
msgid ""
"<p>Advanced Widgets improve your website by providing a flexible way to "
"showcase key statistical insights. Whether through Gutenberg blocks or theme "
"widgets, this add-on makes it easy to present vital stats like traffic, top "
"pages, and browsers to your visitors, offering a richer, data-driven user "
"experience. <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"%s\">Learn more</a></p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Advanced Widget 可提供靈活的方式來展示關鍵的統計資料，從而改善您的網站。無論是透過 Gutenberg 區塊或主題 "
"Widget，此附加元件都能讓您輕鬆向訪客展示流量、頂級頁面和瀏覽器等重要統計資料，提供更豐富、以資料為導向的使用者體驗。<a "
"target=\"_blank\" href=\"%s\">瞭解更多</a></p>。"

#: src/Service/Admin/PrivacyAudit/Faqs/RequireConsent.php:24
msgid ""
"<p>Based on your current configuration, WP Statistics is not recording any "
"personal data. Consequently, under these settings, your use of WP Statistics "
"does not require obtaining user consent. This approach aligns with privacy-"
"focused analytics, minimizing compliance burdens while respecting user "
"privacy.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>基於您目前的配置，WP Statistics 不會記錄任何個人資料。因此，在這些設定下，您使用 WP Statistics "
"無需取得使用者同意。此方法符合注重隱私的分析，在尊重使用者隱私的同時將合規負擔降至最低。"

#. translators: %1$s: string value, %2$s: string value
#: views/components/privacy-audit/recommend-consent-unpassed.php:33
#, php-format
msgid ""
"<p>Check out our %1$s for instructions on configuring a compatible plugin. "
"You can also explore various third-party solutions to ensure compliance and "
"a smooth integration. Browse our list of %2$s to find the best fit for your "
"site.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p> 請參閱我們的 %1$s 以取得設定相容外掛程式的說明。您也可以探索各種第三方解決方案，以確保符合規範並順利整合。瀏覽我們的 %2$s "
"清單，尋找最適合您網站的解決方案。"

#. translators: %s: string value
#: views/components/modals/introduce-premium/step-details.php:52
#, php-format
msgid ""
"<p>Data Plus supercharges WP Statistics by unlocking advanced analytics "
"features. Get deeper insights into your site's performance with tools that "
"help you understand visitor behavior, optimize your content, and track "
"engagement like never before. <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"%s\">Learn more</a>"
"</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Data Plus 透過解鎖先進的分析功能，為 WP Statistics "
"增強了功能。您可以使用各種工具深入瞭解網站的性能，這些工具可以幫助您瞭解訪客的行為、優化內容並追蹤參與程度，這是前所未有的。<a "
"target=\"_blank\" href=\"%s\">瞭解更多</a></p>。"

#: views/components/privacy-audit/visitors-log-unpassed.php:6
msgid ""
"<p>Enabling this feature necessitates a careful approach to privacy and data "
"protection. To maintain compliance with privacy laws such as GDPR and CCPA, "
"and to uphold user trust, please ensure the following:</p>"
msgstr ""
