#: src/Service/Admin/PrivacyAudit/Faqs/TransferData.php:20
msgid ""
"<p>This means that the data resides on the same server as your website, "
"following the same data storage practices. Since WP Statistics does not "
"transfer data outside of your database, the location of your data is "
"determined by your web hosting service. If your hosting servers are located "
"within the EU, your data does not leave the EU. It is essential to be aware "
"of your hosting provider’s data center locations to understand where your "
"website’s data, including that collected by WP Statistics, is physically "
"stored.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p> 這表示資料與您的網站位於同一伺服器上，遵循相同的資料儲存實務。由於WP "
"Statistics不會將資料傳輸到您的資料庫之外，您的資料所在位置由您的網站託管服務決定。如果您的託管服務器位於歐盟內，您的資料不會離開歐盟。了解您的主機供應商的數據中心位置以瞭解您的網站數據（包括WP"
" Statistics收集的數據）的實體存儲位置是非常重要的。"

