msgid ""
"Enter the accumulated count of unique visitors to your site from its "
"inception up to now. For example, if you've transitioned from another "
"tracking tool and it reported 5,000 unique visitors up to the point of "
"switching, input that figure here. This ensures your statistics reflect the "
"entire history of your website's traffic. Currently set to %s."
