#: includes/admin/templates/settings/exclusions.php:122
msgid ""
"Enter the country codes of the countries you want to exclude from tracking. "
"Visitors from these countries will not be logged. Add one country code per "
"line. For a complete list of valid country codes, please refer to the <a "
"href=\"https://wp-statistics.com/resources/list-of-country-codes/?"
"utm_source=wp-statistics&utm_medium=link&utm_campaign=settings\" "
"target=\"_blank\">Country Codes Document</a>."
msgstr ""
"輸入您要排除追蹤的國家的國家代碼。來自這些國家的訪客將不會被記錄。每行新增一個國家代碼。如需有效國家代碼的完整清單，請參閱 <a "
"href=\"https://wp-statistics.com/resources/list-of-country-codes/?"
"utm_source=wp-statistics&utm_medium=link&utm_campaign=settings\" "
"target=\"_blank\"> 國家代碼文件</a>。"

#: includes/admin/templates/settings/exclusions.php:130
msgid ""
"Enter the country codes of the countries you want to include in tracking. "
"Only visitors from these specified countries will be tracked. Add one "
"country code per line. For a complete list of valid country codes, please "
"refer to the <a href=\"https://wp-statistics.com/resources/list-of-country-"
"codes/?utm_source=wp-statistics&utm_medium=link&utm_campaign=settings\" "
"target=\"_blank\" aria-label=\"Country Codes Document\">Country Codes "
"Document</a>."
msgstr ""
"輸入您要列入追蹤的國家的國家代碼。只有來自這些指定國家的訪客才會被追蹤。每行添加一個國家代碼。如需有效國家代碼的完整清單，請參閱 <a "
"href=\"https://wp-statistics.com/resources/list-of-country-codes/?"
"utm_source=wp-statistics&utm_medium=link&utm_campaign=settings\" "
"target=\"_blank\" aria-label=「國家代碼文件」>國家代碼文件</a>。"

