#: includes/admin/templates/pages/author-analytics/authors-performance.php:91
#, php-format
msgid ""
"This section ranks authors based on various performance metrics such as "
"views, publishing frequency, comments per %1$s, and average words per %1$s. "
"Use the tabs to switch between different metrics to see how each author is "
"performing."
