#: views/components/privacy-audit/stored-user-agent-unpassed.php:2
msgid ""
"This setting allows for the collection of complete user agent strings from "
"your visitors, offering detailed insights into their browsing devices and "
"environments. While invaluable for debugging and optimizing user experience, "
"this feature gathers detailed user information, warranting careful use and "
"consideration for privacy."
msgstr ""
"此設定允許從您的訪客收集完整的使用者代理程式字串，以便詳細瞭解他們的瀏覽裝置和環境。雖然此功能對於除錯和優化使用者體驗非常有用，但它會收集詳細的使用者資訊，因此必須小心使用並考慮隱私權。"

#: views/components/privacy-audit/hash-ips.php:2
msgid ""
"This setting applies a secure, irreversible hashing process to IP addresses, "
"transforming them into unique, non-reversible strings. This method of "
"pseudonymization protects user privacy by preventing the possibility of "
"tracing the hash back to the original IP address."
msgstr ""
"此設定會對 IP 位址套用安全、不可逆的散列處理，將其轉換成唯一、不可逆的字串。這種假名化方法可防止將雜湊值追溯到原始 IP 位址，從而保護使用者隱私。"

#: views/components/privacy-audit/anonymize-ips.php:2
msgid ""
"This setting ensures that the IP addresses of your visitors are anonymized "
"by masking the last segment of their IP addresses before any processing or "
"storage occurs. This significantly reduces the risk of personally "
"identifying your users through their IP addresses."
msgstr ""
"此設定可確保在進行任何處理或儲存之前，透過遮蔽訪客 IP 位址的最後一段，將訪客的 IP 位址匿名化。這可大幅降低透過 IP "
"位址辨識使用者個人身分的風險。"

#: views/components/privacy-audit/anonymize-ips-unpassed.php:2
msgid ""
"This setting means that IP addresses could be stored or processed in their "
"complete form, potentially allowing for the identification of individual "
"users based on their IP addresses."
msgstr "此設定意味著 IP 位址可以完整的形式儲存或處理，有可能根據 IP 位址識別個別使用者。"

#: views/components/privacy-audit/visitors-log.php:3
msgid ""
"This status indicates that individual user page views and WordPress user IDs "
"are not being tracked. Your privacy settings are configured to prioritize "
"user privacy in alignment with applicable laws and regulations.</p><p><b>Why "
"is this important?</b></p><p>Keeping this feature disabled ensures that your "
"website minimally impacts user privacy, aligning with best practices for "
"data protection and compliance with privacy laws such as GDPR and CCPA. If "
"your operational or analytical needs change, please review our Guide to <a "
"target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://wp-statistics.com/resources/avoiding-pii-"
"data-collection/?utm_source=wp-"
"statistics&utm_medium=link&utm_campaign=privacy\">Avoiding PII Data "
"Collection</a> to ensure compliance and user transparency before enabling "
"this feature."
msgstr ""
"此狀態表示不會追蹤個別使用者的頁面檢視和 WordPress 使用者 ID。</p><p><b>为什么这很重要？</b></p><p>"
"禁用此功能可确保您的网站对用户隐私的影响降至最低，符合数据保护的最佳实践，并遵守 GDPR 和 CCPA "
"等隐私法律。如果您的作業或分析需求有所改變，請在啟用此功能前檢閱我們的《<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://wp-"
"statistics.com/resources/avoiding-pii-data-collection/?utm_source=wp-"
"statistics&utm_medium=link&utm_campaign=privacy\">避免收集 PII 資料</a>"
"指南》，以確保合規性和使用者透明度。"

#: views/components/privacy-audit/visitors-log-unpassed.php:2
msgid ""
"This status means that individual user page views and WordPress user IDs are "
"being actively tracked. While this functionality provides valuable insights "
"into user behavior, it’s important to handle the collected data responsibly."
msgstr ""
"此狀態表示個別使用者的頁面檢視和 WordPress 使用者 ID "
"正被主動追蹤。雖然這項功能提供了寶貴的使用者行為洞察力，但以負責任的態度處理所收集的資料是很重要的。"

#: includes/class-wp-statistics-db.php:90
msgid ""
"This table captures the relationships between visitors and the content they "
"interact with, helping you understand user behavior and preferences."
msgstr "此表可捕捉訪客與他們互動的內容之間的關係，協助您瞭解使用者的行為和偏好。"

#: views/components/tables/author-pages.php:16
msgid ""
"This table displays author analytics, including author names, their page "
"views, and total published content."
msgstr "此表顯示作者分析，包括作者姓名、其頁面檢視次數和總發表內容。"

#: includes/class-wp-statistics-db.php:86
msgid ""
"This table keeps a record of individual visitors to your website. Each row "
"represents a unique visitor's information and their activities."
msgstr "此表會記錄網站的個別訪客。每一行代表唯一訪客的資訊及其活動。"

#: includes/class-wp-statistics-db.php:88
msgid ""
"This table logs the number of views each page on your website receives. Each "
"row represents the data for a specific page."
msgstr "此表格記錄您網站上每個頁面的瀏覽次數。每一行代表特定頁面的資料。"

#: includes/class-wp-statistics-db.php:87
msgid ""
"This table logs views that have been excluded based on certain criteria, "
"like bots or specific IP addresses. It helps keep your statistics clean from "
"non-human or unwanted traffic."
msgstr "此表格會記錄根據特定條件排除的檢視，例如殭屍或特定 IP 位址。它有助於保持您的統計資料不受非人類或不需要的流量影響。"

#: includes/class-wp-statistics-db.php:89
msgid ""
"This table stores historical data about views and visitors over time. It's "
"useful for tracking trends and patterns in your website's traffic."
msgstr "此表儲存關於瀏覽次數和訪客的歷史資料。它有助於追蹤網站流量的趨勢和模式。"

#: includes/class-wp-statistics-db.php:91
msgid ""
"This table stores the daily aggregated statistics of your website. Each row "
"represents the summarized data for a specific date."
msgstr "此表格儲存您網站的每日彙總統計資料。每一行代表特定日期的彙總資料。"

