msgid ""
"WP Statistics distinguishes itself by utilizing a cookieless tracking "
"mechanism. This means the plugin can provide accurate analytics insights "
"without storing any data on visitors’ devices, thereby respecting user "
"privacy and reducing regulatory burdens for website owners."
msgstr ""
"WP Statistics 的與眾不同之處在於它採用了無 Cookieless "
"追蹤機制。這意味著該外掛可以提供精確的分析洞察，而無需在訪客的設備上存儲任何資料，從而尊重用戶隱私並減少網站所有者的監管負擔。"

