"，因此不需要同意。然而，為了進一步尊重您訪客的隱私並符合最高標準，我們建議您整合同意外掛程式。"

#: views/components/privacy-audit/recommend-consent-unpassed.php:10
msgid ""
"WP Statistics does not require consent by default, as it doesn’t record any "
"Personally Identifiable Information (PII). However, one of your enabled "
"settings collects PII, making visitor consent mandatory to stay compliant "
"with GDPR, CCPA, and other privacy regulations."
msgstr ""
"WP Statistics 預設不需要同意，因為它不會記錄任何個人識別資訊 (PII)。但是，您啟用的其中一項設定會收集 "
"PII，因此必須取得訪客同意，才能符合 GDPR、CCPA 及其他隱私權法規。"

